{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["讚美之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華啊！你是我的上帝，我要尊崇你，讚美你的名。你信實無比，",{"text":"按你古時定下的計劃行了奇妙的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使城邑淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使堅壘淪為荒場。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人的宮殿不復存在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠不能重建。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，強大的民必頌揚你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殘暴之邦的城邑必敬畏你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是貧窮人的避難所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是困苦之人患難中的避難所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是避風港，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是酷暑中的陰涼處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殘暴之徒的氣息好像吹襲牆垣的暴風，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像乾旱之地的熱氣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你平息外族人的喧嘩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"止息殘暴之徒的歌聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像雲朵消去酷熱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在錫安山上，萬軍之耶和華必為天下萬民擺設豐盛的宴席，有陳年佳釀和精選的美食。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["在這山上，祂必除去遮蔽萬民的面紗和籠罩萬國的幔子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["祂必永遠吞滅死亡。主耶和華必擦去各人臉上的眼淚，從世上除掉祂子民的羞辱。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到那日，人們必說：「看啊，這是我們的上帝，我們信靠祂，祂拯救了我們。這是耶和華，我們信靠祂，我們要因祂的救恩而歡喜快樂。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華必伸手保護這山，但摩押人必在本地被踐踏，像乾草被踐踏在糞池中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他們必在裡面張開手臂，好像張開手臂游泳的人一樣。耶和華必摧毀他們的驕傲，挫敗他們手中的詭計。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祂必拆毀他們高大堅固的城牆，將其夷為平地、化為塵土。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}